{"parse":{"title":"特性/吞噬触手","pageid":7284,"revid":17404,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E5%90%9E%E5%99%AC%E8%A7%A6%E6%89%8B&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E5%90%9E%E5%99%AC%E8%A7%A6%E6%89%8B&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E5%90%9E%E5%99%AC%E8%A7%A6%E6%89%8B&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>吞噬触手</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.90.9E.E5.99.AC.E8.A7.A6.E6.89.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"吞噬触手\"><b>吞噬触手</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">特性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"特性 冰原裂齿猪.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/9qg91ojc6ci9irji477j2sp4fngb4bf.png/80px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E8%A3%82%E9%BD%BF%E7%8C%AA.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/9qg91ojc6ci9irji477j2sp4fngb4bf.png/120px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E8%A3%82%E9%BD%BF%E7%8C%AA.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/2/23/9qg91ojc6ci9irji477j2sp4fngb4bf.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />吞噬触手\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:55%;\">\n<p>✦首次处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"濒死\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">濒死</font></span></span>]时，对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内所有敌人造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">120%</font>伤害。<br />✦场上有友军被击败时，攻击最近的敌人造成当前生命值<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>伤害，每回合最多触发1次。<br />✦受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">百分比穿透伤害</span>]降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">80%</font>。<br />拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自然守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">自然守护</font></span></span>]，效果：<br />✦免疫击退、打断。<br />✦物理伤害转为魔法伤害；造成伤害后，对目标施加随机2个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"2级减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">2级减益</font></span></span>]，持续2回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:25%;\" rowspan=\"1\"><b>该特性属于</b><br /><div class=\"hero_box\">\n<div class=\"hero_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%90%9E%E5%99%AC%E8%A7%A6%E6%89%8B\" title=\"魔物图鉴库/吞噬触手\"><img alt=\"吞噬触手 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/bc/g3ldwjvvi2l4xfwr3co0b8fuehoyv06.png/75px-%E5%90%9E%E5%99%AC%E8%A7%A6%E6%89%8B_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/bc/g3ldwjvvi2l4xfwr3co0b8fuehoyv06.png/113px-%E5%90%9E%E5%99%AC%E8%A7%A6%E6%89%8B_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/bc/g3ldwjvvi2l4xfwr3co0b8fuehoyv06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164200\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.064 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.097 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 499/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 10279/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2892/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   79.690      1 模板:特性\n100.00%   79.690      1 -total\n 54.10%   43.109      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n 48.44%   38.603      4 模板:中括号介绍\n 12.94%   10.309      1 模板:面包屑\n  6.51%    5.187      1 模板:魔物图\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:7284-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022164200 and revision id 17404. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"特性","missing":true}],"images":["特性_冰原裂齿猪.png","吞噬触手_像素模型.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"<b>吞噬触手</b>","number":"1","index":"T-1","fromtitle":"模板:特性","byteoffset":null,"anchor":"吞噬触手"}],"displaytitle":"特性/吞噬触手","wikitext":"{{特性\n|魔物名称=吞噬触手\n|特性名称=吞噬触手\n|特性图标=冰原裂齿猪\n|特性描述=✦首次处于[<font color=#f3c156>濒死</font>]时，对自身范围<font color=#ed7950>2</font>格内所有敌人造成<font color=#ed7950>120%</font>伤害。<br>✦场上有友军被击败时，攻击最近的敌人造成当前生命值<font color=#ed7950>20%</font>伤害，每回合最多触发1次。<br>✦受到[百分比穿透伤害]降低<font color=#ed7950>80%</font>。<br>拥有[<font color=#f3c156>自然守护</font>]，效果：<br>✦免疫击退、打断。<br>✦物理伤害转为魔法伤害；造成伤害后，对目标施加随机2个[<font color=#f3c156>2级减益</font>]，持续2回合。\n}}"},"capturedAt":"2026-10-22T16:42:00.693062+00:00"}